      "worked": "Replace $x\\mapsto x+3$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}y&=2^{x+3}\\\\y&=2^3\\times2^x\\\\y&=8\\times2^x\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe equivalent vertical dilation has scale factor $8$.",
